{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42115","headline":"题殷舍人宅木芙蓉 · 徐铉","name":"题殷舍人宅木芙蓉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君庭下木芙蓉，嫋嫋纤枝淡淡红。\n晓吐芳心零宿露，晚摇娇影媚清风。\n似含情态愁秋雨，暗减馨香借菊丛。\n默饮数盃应未称，不知歌管与谁同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}